  "description": "Secure-by-default, post-quantum encryption for sensitive data at rest in Entity Framework Core. Encrypt individual properties (emails, PII, financial and medical data) with authenticated AES-256-GCM, optionally wrapped in an ML-KEM-768 (FIPS 203) hybrid envelope for post-quantum key protection. Clean value-converter API, pluggable key rings for integration with PostQuantum.KeyManagement, honest threat model, and transparent supply chain.",
